# The repo root is the docker build context of the guest's snapshot build (the
# CLI's default, and the reason cartesi.toml is at the root: the bun workspace
# has to resolve inside the build) and of the devnet's own images. Keep the
# context down to what those builds read.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
.cartesi
devnet/snapshot
devnet/deployment
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/dependencies
bin
op-cartesi
